<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Publisher Dashboard</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome, <%= user.username %>!</h1>
    <h2>Your Site's Performance</h2>
    <p>Total Impressions: <%= stats.total_impressions || 0 %></p>
    <p>Total Clicks: <%= stats.total_clicks || 0 %></p>

    <hr>

    <h2>Your Ad Widget Code</h2>
    <p>Copy and paste this code into your website's HTML where you want the ad to appear:</p>
    <textarea rows="4" cols="80" readonly>
<div id="ad-widget-container"></div>
<script src="##YOUR_APP_URL##/widget.js" async></script>
    </textarea>
    <p>Note: You will need to replace '##YOUR_APP_URL##' with the actual URL of your deployed application.</p>

    <br>
    <a href="/logout">Logout</a>

</body>
</html>
